{"id":"ermitteln","lemma":"ermitteln","pos":"verb","rank":3147,"glosses":["to determine, to identify (a value or identity; through a calculation or other process)","to investigate (by the police)"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/a/af/De-ermitteln.ogg/De-ermitteln.ogg.mp3","conjugation":{"indicative":{"present":{"1s":"ermittle","1p":"ermitteln","2s":"ermittelst","2p":"ermittelt","3s":"ermittelt","3p":"ermitteln"},"preterite":{"1s":"ermittelte","1p":"ermittelten","2s":"ermitteltest","2p":"ermitteltet","3s":"ermittelte","3p":"ermittelten"},"perfect":{"1s":"habe ermittelt","1p":"haben ermittelt","2s":"hast ermittelt","2p":"habt ermittelt","3s":"hat ermittelt","3p":"haben ermittelt"},"future":{"1s":"werde ermitteln","1p":"werden ermitteln","2s":"wirst ermitteln","2p":"werdet ermitteln","3s":"wird ermitteln","3p":"werden ermitteln"}},"imperative":{"affirmative":{"2s":"ermittle","2p":"ermittelt"}},"subjunctive":{"conditional":{"1s":"würde ermitteln","1p":"würden ermitteln","2s":"würdest ermitteln","2p":"würdet ermitteln","3s":"würde ermitteln","3p":"würden ermitteln"}}},"nonFinite":{"participle":"ermittelt"},"examples":[{"text":"Wir werden in dieser Sache ermitteln.","en":"We'll investigate the matter.","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"to become"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"this one, this"},{"g":"matter"},null]},{"text":"Wir wollen sehen, was sich ermitteln lässt.","en":"Let's see what we can find out.","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"to want"},{"g":"to see"},{"g":"what"},{"g":"oneself"},null,{"g":"to allow","l":"lassen"}]},{"text":"Wir müssen ermitteln, wer das getan hat.","en":"We have to find out who did this.","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"to have to"},null,{"g":"who"},{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"to do","l":"tun"},{"g":"has","l":"haben"}]},{"text":"Die Polizei ermittelte, wo der Täter wohnte.","en":"The police found out where the criminal lived.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"police"},null,{"g":"where"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"perpetrator"},{"g":"to live, reside, dwell","